From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Include nx2_debug_control.h on aarch64 for WaitForFlag EXP103

Stock fritchii-v6.1 only pulls video_core/nx2_debug_control.h under
ARCHITECTURE_x86_64, but WaitForFlag uses VideoCore::Nx2Debug::Experiment(103)
unconditionally — arm64 Thor CI fails to compile common/thread.cpp.

---
 src/common/thread.cpp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/common/thread.cpp b/src/common/thread.cpp
--- a/src/common/thread.cpp
+++ b/src/common/thread.cpp
@@ -455,14 +455,14 @@ void RememberCurrentThreadNice(pid_t tid, s32 nice_value) {
 #endif
 
 #include "common/cpu_features.h"
+#include "video_core/nx2_debug_control.h"
 #ifdef ARCHITECTURE_x86_64
 #ifdef _MSC_VER
 #include <intrin.h>
 #else
 #include <x86intrin.h>
 #endif
 #include "common/x64/rdtsc.h"
-#include "video_core/nx2_debug_control.h"
 #endif
 
 #ifdef _WIN32
